ALCHEMIST-FROTH.description:
[gold]Ferment{FermentSuffix}.[/gold]
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Hits an additional time for each turn fermented.{HitsLine}

ALCHEMIST-POUR_OVER.description:
Choose a [gold]Ferment[/gold] card in your [gold]Hand[/gold].
Move ALL of its fermentation to another [gold]Ferment[/gold] card{IfUpgraded:show:
, then [gold]Trigger[/gold] it.|.}

ALCHEMIST-QUENCH.description:
Gain {antitoxin:diff()} [gold]Antitoxin[/gold].
Gain [gold]Block[/gold] equal to twice your [gold]Antitoxin[/gold].{InCombat:
(Gains {CalculatedBlock:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold])|}

ALCHEMIST-SWEAT_IT_OUT.description:
[gold]Ferment{FermentSuffix}.[/gold]
Gain {SelfPoison} [gold]Poison[/gold], plus {FermentPoison:diff()} for each turn fermented.
Apply [gold]Poison[/gold] equal to your [gold]Poison[/gold] to ALL enemies.{ApplyLine}
